<!-- aireg-publish-preview -->
<h3>✅ Ready to merge</h3>
<p>Merging into <code>release/next</code> publishes nothing; only the default branch publishes. From there, this publishes <b>1 artifact</b> to <code>acme/engineering</code> · 1 update</p>
<p>⚠️ From the default branch, this also republishes skill <code>review</code> over a newer registry version, though this pull request leaves it unchanged. Merge the default branch into this branch to keep the registry's version.</p>
<p>🔒 No token for <code>acme</code>, because this pull request merges into <code>release/next</code>, not the default branch.</p>

<table>
<tr><th align="left" width="330">Artifact</th><th align="left" width="250">Change</th><th align="left" width="180">Version</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>review</code> <sub>skill</sub></td><td>⚠️ Replaces newer<br><sub>deletes <code>rules/old.md</code></sub></td><td><code>0.3.1</code> → <code>0.3.2</code></td></tr>
</table>
`;

